			"Message": "feat(Mountain): Add Vine notification subscription for Sky/Wind and streaming multiplexer fallback\n\nAdd `VineSubscribeCommand` Tauri command surface that exposes the process-wide Vine notification broadcast to Sky/Wind via a `Channel<NotificationFramePayload>`. This enables the frontend to subscribe to notifications from Cocoon with the same ordering and drop-oldest semantics as in-process Rust subscribers. Effect-TS layer wraps this into a `Stream<NotificationFrame>`.\n\nAlso add conditional streaming multiplexer support in `Vine::Client` for both `SendRequest` and `SendNotification` when `LAND_VINE_STREAMING=1` is set. The multiplexer path attempts h2-multiplexed streaming and falls back to the unary path on any failure, ensuring the editor remains functional while Cocoon's streaming handler tree lands (currently returns Unimplemented).\n\nThis completes the P14.x notification subscription surface, complementing the P14.3/P14.2 multiplexer integration in Client.rs.",
			"SHA": "f31941aa4bbbc67256d113d8d2788add73d49c7c"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-30T01:24:15Z",
			"File": [
				"⡇⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				867,
				76
			],
			"Message": "feat(Mountain): Implement mmap asset cache, path canon cache, and Vine streaming foundation\n\nThis patch (B7-S6 P2) lands three major infrastructure components:\n\n**Asset Memory Map Cache** (`Cache/AssetMemoryMap.rs`):\n- File-backed mmap cache for bundled workbench assets (~80 MB of JS/CSS/fonts)\n- Eliminates per-request `read(2)` + heap allocation duplication of OS page cache\n- Auto-discovers pre-brotli-compressed `<file>.br` siblings for `Accept-Encoding: br`\n- Uses `DashMap` for lock-free concurrent reads\n\n**Path Canonicalization Cache** (`Cache/PathCanon.rs`):\n- Process-wide canonical path cache keyed by lexical input path\n- Collapses repeated `dunce::canonicalize` calls from fs-scope security gate\n- 60s TTL bounds staleness; moka handles eviction\n- Saves ~150ms cumulative boot time across 113 extensions + 80 chunks\n\n**Vine Streaming Foundation** (`Vine/Multiplexer.rs`, proto changes):\n- Adds `Envelope` protobuf message for multiplexed frame format\n- Adds `OpenChannelFromCocoon`/`OpenChannelFromMountain` bidirectional streaming RPCs\n- Multiplexer owns the h2 stream; notifications fan out via broadcast channel\n- Stub returns Unimplemented until P14 lands streaming handler tree\n- Tuned tonic transport (4 MB stream window) for rust-analyzer diagnostic storms\n\n**Scheme Handler Fixes**:\n- MIME-honesty on 404: swap HTML body → empty text/plain for asset requests\n- Route asset reads through mmap cache\n- Serve Brotli precompressed siblings when client offers `Accept-Encoding: br`\n\n**Air Sidecar Integration** (`Service/AirStart.rs`):\n- Spawns Air daemon at boot alongside Cocoon\n- Connects via gRPC over `[::1]:50053`\n- Graceful degradation if Air unavailable\n\n**Misc Fixes**:\n- `nativeHost:getCursorScreenPoint` stub returns `{x:0, y:0}` to silence IPC spam\n- `FindFilesInWorkspace` diagnostic logging for zero-results debugging\n- HandlerRegistry.json regenerated (111 handlers)",
			"SHA": "87bdf4c0cc831bcc4b105b190f66f0eb5eefc544"
		}
